{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "english", "appid": 924970, "month": "2026-07", "window": 3, "start_date": 1784160000, "end_date": 1784851199, "month_true_total": 111, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 20:55:16 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "231159884", "author": {"steamid": "76561198029181502", "personaname": "King Noob", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198029181502/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 95, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 95, "last_played": 1659879979, "avatar": "7afa784ca9853eb5a348aca4ca2f3f32a879745b"}, "language": "english", "review": "I didnt play all that long. I just couldn't get passed the card mechanism. I had high hope, since Left 4 Dead. \nThey should've just made it simple and funny, instead of those upgrades", "timestamp_created": 1784849721, "timestamp_updated": 1784849721, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.490196079015731812", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "231052375", "author": {"steamid": "76561199095935086", "personaname": "HandyCapd", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199095935086/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 1646, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1463, "last_played": 1785116661, "avatar": "c910dd03cac345f4c13e4e7f34cfbc5afdc12cec"}, "language": "english", "review": "dead and gone lmao. dont buy it unless its free", "timestamp_created": 1784730328, "timestamp_updated": 1784730328, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.510043680667877197", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "231015975", "author": {"steamid": "76561198005509703", "personaname": "King Dangerbutt", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198005509703/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 4034, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4029, "last_played": 1786199023, "avatar": "4c46a077d1b134840cb951b9d5fd57b5ed1b396f"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is one of my favorites despite the bad reputation. I am looking forward to a B4B2.\n\nThere is little variety in levels as you play the same zones but different routes. However, the Acts are so long, this doesn't bother me too much. \n\nThe Mutants are oddly balanced. They are either a pain or too weak. There are roughly 4 types with 3 variations. It is hard to keep track as the variations have minor visual differences yet the tactics to take them down are slightly different. Reekers are dumb and fun to kill. The Tallboy is wildly overpowered compared to the others because it hides its weakspot. The Spitters are a joke and die easy. The Wailers are either canon fodder or will pin you down.\n\nAt first I hated the card system because it made the game feel bloated and overwhelming. Once you get used to it, it's actually really fun the kind of builds you can make. Have a problem with friendly fire? Use \"Down in Front\" problem solved. \n\nNo cash shop and everything is unlockable (besides DLC) in-game. A lost form in modern games that many will overlook.\n\nThe bots are crazy overpowered and with Offline mode, this game can be played solo. Best played with one or two other friends. Once you start playing 4-player, you will notice how good the bots are.", "timestamp_created": 1784679377, "timestamp_updated": 1784679377, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "230998515", "author": {"steamid": "76561198379182217", "personaname": "Cosmic_Bake_Potato", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198379182217/", "num_games_owned": 796, "num_reviews": 37, "playtime_forever": 80, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 80, "last_played": 1784660340, "avatar": "10dc390a0f22f67d2f765283e242c809d4bc757a"}, "language": "english", "review": "this game is like eating a sandwich but every time you try to take a bite you get kicked in the balls by a pissed off grizzly bear", "timestamp_created": 1784660516, "timestamp_updated": 1784660516, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 51, "votes_funny": 32, "weighted_vote_score": "0.732493579387664795", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 28, "count": 4}, {"reaction_type": 31, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "230998363", "author": {"steamid": "76561198147861920", "personaname": "Bestas", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/BestasYT/", "num_games_owned": 1287, "num_reviews": 133, "playtime_forever": 93, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 80, "last_played": 1784812615, "avatar": "4dc90bd16be340f5e67f3d35e1dc98fad0084e47"}, "language": "english", "review": "\"eh\" would be an understatement", "timestamp_created": 1784660357, "timestamp_updated": 1784660357, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.495188444852828979", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false